Modifications and original work in this tree (Apache-2.0 as well):

    * hrm_gear/                 local runtime, tokenisation, ACT loops
    * hrm_gear/compat/          MPS/CPU SDPA stand-in for FlashAttention
    * scripts/                  inference smoke harnesses
    * docs/                     architecture, environment, experiments
    * config/model_matrix.v1.yaml
    * README.md                 project charter (replaces upstream README
                                at the repository root; upstream README is
                                preserved at docs/upstream/HRM.README.md)

Dataset submodules referenced by upstream remain under their own licenses
(see .gitmodules): François Chollet / ARC Prize ARC-AGI, ARC-AGI-2, and
ConceptARC.

FlashAttention (Tri Dao et al.) is an upstream training dependency.
This fork does not vendor FlashAttention. On Apple Silicon we substitute
torch.nn.functional.scaled_dot_product_attention. That substitution is
an inference-only compatibility layer, not a claim of FlashAttention
numerics or performance.
